cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Marine Engine Fault Dataset"
version: "1.0"
type: dataset
date-released: 2026-01-01   # set to your release date
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.19857425
abstract: >-
  Measurement data from a controlled experimental campaign on a Matsui Iron Works
  MU323DGSC marine diesel engine, comprising a baseline reference-performance dataset
  and five fault/anomaly scenario classes (compressor air-filter clogging, air-cooler
  fouling, injection-valve nozzle clogging, cooling-water pump cavitation, and turbine
  degradation) recorded at fixed engine loads.
keywords:
  - marine diesel engine
  - condition monitoring
  - fault diagnosis
  - anomaly detection
  - turbocharger
  - time-series
